@ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5247

### Create user
POST {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@scorehistory.local",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "name": "Novo Usuário"
}

### Login
POST {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@scorehistory.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Me (replace TOKEN)
GET {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Dashboard summary
GET {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Dashboard head to head
GET {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/head-to-head
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Dashboard tips
GET {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/tips
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Opponents (paginated)
GET {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/opponents?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Matches (paginated)
GET {{ScoreHistory.Api_HostAddress}}/api/matches?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
